OL,3,AEx-wife of Zimbabwe's vice-president
OL,4,Afreed after collapse of attempted
OL,5,Amurder case
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former wife of Zimbabwe's
OL,8,Fvice-president has been freed from
OL,9,Fremand after seven years while on trial
OL,10,Ffor his attempted murder.
OL,12,FMarry Mubaiwa was charged in 2019,
OL,13,Fafter her then husband Gen Constantino
OL,14,FChiwenga accused her of trying to
OL,15,Fimpede his medical treatment in South
OL,16,FAfrica.
OL,18,FOrdering her release, a magistrate said
OL,19,FMubaiwa had suffered mental, physical
OL,20,Fand financial prejudice during the
OL,21,Ftrial, state-owned daily the Herald
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
